---
title: Sequence diagram - client uploads a new copy of a rejected document
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor C as Client
    participant W as Web portal<br/>ClientDocumentsPage.jsx, lib/documents.js
    participant MW as API pipeline<br/>JWT bearer + role check
    participant DC as DocumentsController
    participant FS as API file system<br/>wwwroot/uploads
    participant DB as PostgreSQL<br/>Case, DocumentType, Document

    C->>W: picks a file for a rejected document
    W->>W: uploadFileError: PDF, JPG or PNG, not empty, 5 MB or less
    alt fails the browser check
        W-->>C: error under the file picker, nothing sent
    else passes
        W->>MW: POST /api/documents/upload (multipart, Bearer token)
        alt token missing or expired
            MW-->>W: 401, web refreshes once and retries (see seq-login)
        else role not Admin, Consultant or Client
            MW-->>W: 403
        else authorised
            MW->>DC: UploadDocument(IFormFile)
            alt no file or empty
                DC-->>W: 400 "No file uploaded."
            else over 5 MB
                DC-->>W: 400 "File size exceeds the 5MB limit."
            else extension not .pdf .jpg .jpeg .png
                DC-->>W: 400 "Invalid file type. Only PDF, JPG, and PNG are allowed."
            else valid
                DC->>FS: save as {new Guid}.{ext}
                DC-->>W: 200 {fileName, filePath: /uploads/{guid}.{ext}}
                W->>MW: POST /api/documents {caseId, documentTypeId, fileName, filePath}
                MW->>DC: CreateDocument(dto)
                alt model invalid
                    DC-->>W: 400 ApiErrorResponse {errors[]}
                else client does not own the case (or consultant not assigned)
                    DC->>DB: Case where Id = caseId and ClientId = user
                    DC-->>W: 403
                else case or document type not found
                    DC-->>W: 404
                else ok
                    DC->>DB: INSERT Document (Status = Pending)
                    DC-->>W: 201 Created
                    W-->>C: toast, rejected copy hidden, new copy shows "Awaiting review"
                end
            end
        end
    end
    Note over W,DC: If the second call fails, the saved file stays in wwwroot/uploads with no Document row.<br/>No audit row is written for an upload.
